## Exit criteria

- [ ] SKILL.md and all current parallel references expose only inventory,
  identify, rerun, challenge, complete; requesting k performs1..k. No command
  aliases. Reuse valid computations while rereading all cumulative sections,
  correcting and recording contradictions after every stage.
- [ ] Every stage compiles the local report through its latest section and
  updates one local Zotero-note draft; unresolved I4R rows say not yet run.
  Opening exists from inventory; complete rewrites introduction/conclusion and
  AI Disclosure using provenance collected from the start. Existing host
  outward-note/publication gates remain.
- [ ] Identify follows introduction, runs unattended with targeted verified
  checks, separates causal-graph fidelity/credibility where applicable and
  generic scientific argument/model/facts elsewhere, and lists literature
  support still needed before publication. Deep literature is separate.
- [ ] Rerun honors caller scope, otherwise asks main result/I4R scope/whole
  paper before computation, with five-minute main-result default. Automatic
  resume is optional; honest manual-resume fallback suffices. I4R scope uses
  authoritative primary sources. Execution scope never substitutes for the
  canonical whole-paper dossier or changes selected-target contracts.
- [ ] Challenge derives signed checks from identification threats, including
  one outside the paper's statistical frame, preserves complete dispositions
  and1584 approval boundaries, and has no signature timeout.
- [ ] Existing assessment/CSV/ACRe/tolerance/blind-source contracts and frozen
  folders remain intact. Temporary mapping has an explicit removal condition
  after old-name tickets close; no silent migration of frozen artifacts.
- [ ] Verify source/scenario controls for stage ordering, resumed idempotence,
  contradictory later finding, missing execution, caller scope, unanswered
  question/manual continuation, signature refusal, and blind advisor discovery;
  run required catalog/hygiene, semantic review, gaze, and merge gate.

One coherent documentation/interface unit is intended. Reconsider decomposition
if implementation proves to need an independently landing helper or schema;
report before executing that new scope. No runtime service, estimates, paid
API, probabilities, composite scoring, or new publication authority.
